            "content": "<p>\"After a small delay, I finally received my TryScent perfumes and they're just right! I can hardly believe how accurate they are compared to the originals. For reference: I got \"Ylang Ylang Rose Jasmine\" and \"Aldehydes Rose Sandalwood\" — they are truly beautiful scents\"</p>",
