=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span>\n            <span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"mp-verified\">Verified buyer</span>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8220;Wow, just unbelievably good.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>At first I was a little worried because the delivery was delayed. But once the perfume arrived and the scent had settled: wow.</p>\n        <p class=\"mp-result\">Worth the wait.</p>\n        <div class=\"mp-card-foot\"><strong>Lars de Boer</strong></div>\n      </article>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mp-nav\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"mp-arrow\" data-mp-prev aria-label=\"Previous review\">&#8249;</button>\n      <div class=\"mp-dots\" data-mp-dots></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"mp-arrow\" data-mp-next aria-label=\"Next review\">&#8250;</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var root = document.getElementById('mp-reviews-custom');\n  if (!root) return;\n  var track = root.querySelector('[data-mp-carousel]');\n  var cards = Array.prototype.slice.call(track.children);\n  var dotsWrap = root.querySelector('[data-mp-dots]');\n  var prev = root.querySelector('[data-mp-prev]');\n  var next = root.querySelector('[data-mp-next]');\n  if (!cards.length) return;\n\n  function step(){ return cards.length > 1 ? cards[1].offsetLeft - cards[0].offsetLeft : track.clientWidth; }\n  function positions(){ return Math.max(1, cards.length - Math.round(track.clientWidth / step()) + 1); }\n  function current(){\n    var max = track.scrollWidth - track.clientWidth;\n    if (track.scrollLeft >= max - 2) return positions() - 1;\n    return Math.round(track.scrollLeft / step());\n  }\n  function go(i){ track.scrollTo({left: i * step(), behavior: 'smooth'}); }\n\n  function buildDots(){\n    dotsWrap.innerHTML = '';\n    for (var i = 0; i < positions(); i++) {\n      var d = document.createElement('button');\n      d.type = 'button';\n      d.className = 'mp-dot';\n      d.setAttribute('aria-label', 'Review ' + (i + 1));\n      d.addEventListener('click', go.bind(null, i));\n      dotsWrap.appendChild(d);\n    }\n    update();\n  }\n\n  function update(){\n    var c = current(), n = positions();\n    Array.prototype.forEach.call(dotsWrap.children, function(d, i){\n      d.classList.toggle('active', i === c);\n    });\n    prev.disabled = c <= 0;\n    next.disabled = c >= n - 1;\n  }\n\n  prev.addEventListener('click', function(){\n    go(Math.max(0, current() - 1));\n  });\n\n  next.addEventListener('click', function(){\n    go(Math.min(positions() - 1, current() + 1));\n  });\n\n  var t;\n  track.addEventListener('scroll', function(){\n    clearTimeout(t);\n    t = setTimeout(update, 60);\n  });\n\n  window.addEventListener('resize', buildDots);\n  buildDots();\n})();\n</script>",
